<title>USA: Tyson sets three-for-two stock split.</title>
<headline>Tyson sets three-for-two stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGDALE, Ark 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyson Foods Inc said on Friday it will make a three-for-two stock split, effective on February 15.</p>
</text>
